\hP{וַיִּקַּח}
\hP{קֹרַח בֶּן יִצְהָר בֶּן קְהָת בֶּן לֵוִי}
\hJ{וְדָתָן וַאֲבִירָם בְּנֵי אֱלִיאָב וְאוֹן בֶּן פֶּלֶת בְּנֵי רְאוּבֵן׃}

tex.english:
\eP{And}
\eP{Korah son of Izhar son of Kohath son of Levi,}
\eJ{and Dathan and Abiram, sons of Eliab, and On, son of Peleth,
	sons of Reuben,}
\eP{took}

\eJ{and got up in front of Moses—}
\eP{and two hundred fifty people from the children of Israel,
	chieftains of the congregation, prominent ones of the assembly,
	people of repute.}

\eP{
	And he spoke to Korah and to all of his congregation,
	saying, “In the morning YHWH will make known who is His
	and who is holy, and He will bring him close to Him. And
	He will bring the one He chooses close to Him.
}

\eP{
	Do this: Take incense burners, Korah and all his
	congregation,
}

\eP{
