}

tex.commentary:
\aA{
	The woman, who has presumably stepped outside to give
	them privacy, comes back and says:
}

\aA{
	``Look Saul, I risked my life helping you. You know Saul
	has prohibited speaking with ghosts and now you've gone
	and got me in trouble with Saul.''
}

tex.english:
\eJ{
	So now you listen to me: Let me set before you a bit of food. Eat,
	and then you will have the strength to go on your way.”
}

tex.commentary:
\aA{
	``Let me give you some food so you can leave.''
}

tex.english:
\eJ{
	He refused, saying, “I will not eat.” But when his courtiers as
