}

tex.commentary:
\aA{
	She kills an entire cow and whips up some quick cakes.
}

tex.english:
\eJ{
	She set this before Saul and his courtiers, and they ate. Then
	they rose and left the same night.
}

tex.commentary:
\aA{
	She gives the entire cow and the cakes to the guys and
	they leave.
}

tex.english:
\eJ{
	The Philistines mustered all their forces at Aphek, while Israel
	was encamping at the spring in Jezreel.
}

tex.commentary:
\aA{
	Cut back to 28:5.
}

\aA{
	A war was about to happen but then Saul was scared so we
	did a digression about ghosts.
}

\aA{
	Back to the war.
}

tex.english:
\eJ{
	The Philistine lords came marching, each with his units of
